"WooCommerce is not installed or activated. This block requires WooCommerce "
"to function."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce er ikke installeret eller aktiveret. Dette blok kræver "
"WooCommerce for at fungere."

#: includes/class-wccty-order-confirmation-renderer.php:253
msgid ""
"Order Confirmation — this area displays the customer's order details "
"(items, totals, and addresses) on your Thank You page. There is no order to "
"preview here yet."
msgstr ""
"Ordrebekræftelse — dette område viser kundens ordredetaljer (varer, totaler "
"og adresser) på din takkeside. Der er endnu ingen ordre at forhåndsvise her."

#: includes/class-wccty-order-confirmation-renderer.php:259
